does the deal mean for Kyiv and Moscow?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Albania: Fire at Education Ministry as students protest</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:29163323c74e90fd46b9d3abd1fcfa834af0084649c947e738ab1f13dda0d21a</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:53Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T14:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/albania-fire-at-education-ministry-as-students-protest/a-79661193--fb85f85aef8b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/albania-fire-at-education-ministry-as-students-protest/a-79661193?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Riot police deployed in the Albanian capital Tirana on the second day of student protests. The sudden outbreak seemed at least somewhat reminiscent of the widespread demos in France courting international attention.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Climate change and drone attacks exacerbate the humanitarian crisis in war-torn Sudan</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bda54c855ded6d3ab7515161c21871923f2cdeb6230126ed9b042b0445f0216c</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:53Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T14:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/climate-change-and-drone-attacks-exacerbate-the-humanitarian-crisis-in-war-torn-sudan/a-79659603--fd7677b9a8bc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/climate-change-and-drone-attacks-exacerbate-the-humanitarian-crisis-in-war-torn-sudan/a-79659603?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Aid groups warn of an imminent collapse of the health system as fighting continues to displace civilians amid the planting season. The UN has extended an arms embargo, but only for Darfur.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Indonesian VIP prison scandal exposes inequality across Southeast Asia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b2736365822c4e07ef716549eabae94d54b4f9d0aac74f14c6a8f6c10df16211<